{{!-- Structured data for a collection INDEX page (/courses/, /videos/,
/blog/ …).

partials/json-ld.hbs already emits the site graph (WebSite,
Organization, navigation) and the page-level type for an individual
POST. This is the missing half: the listing pages themselves. Without
it a crawler sees /courses/ as an untyped document and has to infer
the catalogue from the markup.

Params
  name      human title of the collection    "Courses"
  path      path segment, no slashes         "courses"
  filter    the same NQL the route uses      "tag:hash-course"
  itemType  schema type for entries          "Course" · optional,
                                             defaults to ListItem only

One parameterised partial rather than twelve hand-written blocks, so
adding a collection is one include rather than a new file. Keep the
`filter` argument identical to the collection's filter in routes.yaml
— if they drift, the page and its structured data describe different
sets of posts.

Note `items.[0]` rather than `{{#if items}}`: an empty array is truthy
in Handlebars, which would emit an ItemList with an empty
itemListElement. --}}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
        {
            "@type": "CollectionPage",
            "@id": "{{@site.url}}/{{path}}/#collection",
            "url": "{{@site.url}}/{{path}}/",
            "name": "{{name}}",
            "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{@site.url}}/#website" },
            "breadcrumb": { "@id": "{{@site.url}}/{{path}}/#crumbs" }{{#get "posts" filter=filter limit="1" as |probe|}}{{#if probe.[0]}},
            "mainEntity": { "@id": "{{@site.url}}/{{path}}/#items" }{{/if}}{{/get}}
        },
        {
            "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
            "@id": "{{@site.url}}/{{path}}/#crumbs",
            "itemListElement": [
                { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "{{@site.url}}/" },
                { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "{{name}}", "item": "{{@site.url}}/{{path}}/" }
            ]
        }{{#get "posts" filter=filter order="published_at desc" limit="100" as |items|}}{{#if items.[0]}},
        {
            "@type": "ItemList",
            "@id": "{{@site.url}}/{{path}}/#items",
            "name": "{{name}}",
            "numberOfItems": {{items.length}},
            "itemListOrder": "https://schema.org/ItemListOrderDescending",
            "itemListElement": [
                {{#foreach items}}
                {
                    "@type": "ListItem",
                    "position": {{@number}},
                    "url": "{{url absolute="true"}}"{{#if ../../itemType}},
                    "item": {
                        "@type": "{{../../itemType}}",
                        "@id": "{{url absolute="true"}}#item",
                        "name": "{{title}}",
                        "url": "{{url absolute="true"}}"{{#if custom_excerpt}},
                        "description": "{{custom_excerpt}}"{{/if}}{{#if feature_image}},
                        "image": "{{img_url feature_image size="l" absolute="true"}}"{{/if}},
                        "provider": { "@id": "{{@site.url}}/#organization" },
                        "isAccessibleForFree": true
                    }{{else}},
                    "name": "{{title}}"{{/if}}
                }{{#unless @last}},{{/unless}}
                {{/foreach}}
            ]
        }{{/if}}{{/get}}
    ]
}
</script>
